Tunneling GUI set-up

Hardware:
+ Raspberry Pi 5
+ Display monitor - dedicated monitor or laptop
+	Screen size TBD

Sensor readings/reqs
+ Drill RPM: Monitors cutterhead’s rotational speed
+ Drill Depth: Measure digging progress and current depth
+ Motor Current: Monitors current drawn from the motor
+ Motor Temperature: Detects temperature and overheating
+ Machine Inclination: Measure deviation from initial inclination
+ Travel Limits: Detects end of travel position
+ Feed speed can be derived from drill depth rather than directly measured
+ Low/High warnings and interlocks
+ output voltage, current, and supply temperature

Buttons:
+ Start button
+ Shutdown button
+ Option to disable interlock
+ E-brake release

Other info:
+ Current state/task progress
+ Connection to controller (network loss)
+ Power connection
+ All Interlock statuses
+ E-brake data
